{"version":1,"content":"<p>天水圍+WOO嘉湖二期商場（前稱嘉湖銀座）本月維修入口玻璃尖塔，搭起巨型錐形竹棚，有市民專程前來拍照。</p><p>明報電子平台組記者今日（15日）走訪該商場，見竹枝縱橫交錯，沿尖塔向上收窄。</p><p>中午時分，陽光穿透棚架，映出層層線條。</p><p>（採訪、拍攝、剪接：歐蕙瑩）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:39:59.208255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:09:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:44.622982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:38.333221+00:00","content_hash":"009af1b45cd08c5a10ee7ac1fdee5a0ed9c52c2e96ae5745991cbe8ebd62acc0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}